  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afro-descendents developing agro-ecological systems in Talamanca, to improve their quality of life and contribute to environmental conservation.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACBTC will incorporate 10 additional Afro- Costa Rican cacao producers to the Coopecacao Afro en el Caribe Sur, a new organization of 25 farmers founded as part of the original grant activities. The producers will design and build cacao fermenters and dryers, develop a feasibility study for a small chocolate processing business and create an agro- tourism route and market it to tourist agencies and local visitors.</narrative>
  </description>
